WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.325
The turtle follows your commands one at a time, from the top down.

2
00:00:05.275 --> 00:00:10.175
Forward 100 moves the turtle 100 steps and draws a line.

3
00:00:11.251 --> 00:00:15.051
Right 90 turns the turtle a quarter turn without moving.

4
00:00:16.177 --> 00:00:18.527
The next forward goes the new way.
